Box 51877 (0 of 3 on 0122): one saver tagged the owner „სტომატოლოგი", the
other „კბილის ექიმი". The second was read by its word „ექიმი" as a plain
doctor, so there were two trades of one saver each and the list was empty.

The dentists are a profession family now (სტომატოლოგი, კბილის ექიმი,
dentist, stomatologist), and a label is read for the longest family
phrase standing in it as whole words before the occupation dictionary's
single words, so „ნანა კბილის ექიმი" is a dentist, not a doctor. The
family also widens a dentist search to the same words, as the other
families do.

